#: includes/class-sr-admin.php
msgid "Swarm Rebuild Settings"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The rebuild plays automatically on every visit to pages in scope — finished "
"elements become clickable while the swarm is still building. Visitors who "
"dismissed the animation (Esc or the card) keep that choice in their browser."
msgstr ""
"重建动画会在范围内页面每次访问时自动播放——构建过程中,绘制完成的元素即可点击。访客按 "
"Esc 或用卡片关闭过动画的选择会在其浏览器中保留。"

msgid ""
"Settings travel to visitors inside the page HTML: saving automatically "
"purges common page caches (WP Super Cache, W3 Total Cache, WP Rocket, "
"LiteSpeed). If a CDN caches full HTML on top of those, refresh it there as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"设置信息随页面 HTML 一起送达访客:保存时会自动清除常见页面缓存(WP Super Cache、W3 Total "
"Cache、WP Rocket、LiteSpeed)。如果 CDN 还在之上缓存整页 HTML,请再在 CDN 侧刷新。"

msgid "Where to enable"
msgstr ""

msgid "Front page only"
msgstr ""

msgid "Specific URLs"
msgstr ""

msgid "Entire site"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One path per line (e.g. about or pricing). Used when \"Specific URLs\" is "
"selected."
msgstr ""

msgid "Return to the live page when finished"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The rebuild plays on every visit; finished links are clickable while it "
"builds. When on, the canvas exits back to the live page within half a second "
"of the rebuild completing. When off, the rebuilt page stays until the "
"visitor clicks a link or exits."
msgstr ""
"重建动画每次访问都会播放;构建过程中已完成的链接即可点击。开启时,重建完成后 0.5 秒内退出画布回到真实页面;关闭时,重建页将保留,直到访客点击链接或退出。"

msgid "Sound on by default"
msgstr ""

msgid "Visitors can mute on the card; the choice sticks in their browser."
msgstr ""

msgid "Tour on by default"
msgstr ""

msgid "Auto-scroll follows the swarm while it builds. Visitors can pause it on the card."
msgstr ""

msgid "Transparent backdrop"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Detect the site wallpaper (fixed canvas/video/image or pseudo-element "
"background layers) and keep it visible during the animation. Turning this "
"off always uses a solid-color wipe — the safe mode if the wallpaper "
"misbehaves on your theme."
msgstr ""
"自动检测站点壁纸(fixed 定位的画布/视频/图片或伪元素背景层)并在动画中保持可见。关闭后始终使用实色擦除——当你的主题壁纸表现异常时选这个安全模式。"

msgid "Wallpaper elements (CSS selectors)"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One CSS selector per line, e.g. #content or .site-bg. Manual fallback for "
"wallpapers the automatic detection misses; elements are kept visible during "
"the animation. Only used while the transparent backdrop is on."
msgstr ""
"每行一个 CSS 选择器,如 #content 或 .site-bg。为自动检测遗漏的壁纸提供手动兜底;这些元素在动画中将保持可见。仅在透明背景模式开启时生效。"

msgid "How do I find the selector?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Examples: #content (Argon-style pseudo-element wallpapers), .site-bg "
"(dedicated background div), #background-video (video wallpaper wrapper), "
"canvas.wallpaper (class-named fullscreen canvas)."
msgstr ""
"示例:#content(Argon 类伪元素壁纸)、.site-bg(专用背景 div)、#background-video(视频壁纸"
"外层容器)、canvas.wallpaper(带类名的全屏画布)。"

msgid ""
"Find it: open your site, press F12, pick the inspector arrow and click the "
"wallpaper — the highlighted element's id or first class is your selector. If "
"it cannot be clicked (pseudo-element layers), paste the snippet below into "
"the browser console to list candidates, then fill one per line."
msgstr ""
"查找方法:打开你的站点按 F12,用左上角检查箭头点击壁纸区域——高亮元素的 id 或第一个 class 就是"
"选择器。点不到的(伪元素图层)把下方片段贴进浏览器控制台列出候选,再逐行填入。"

msgid ""
"Do not list plain content containers that carry no wallpaper (harmless but "
"useless). If a theme still misbehaves, turn off \"Transparent backdrop\" — it "
"always uses a safe solid-color wipe."
msgstr ""
"不要填写不含壁纸的普通内容容器(无害但无意义)。如果主题仍然异常,关闭“透明背景模式”——它始终使用安全的实色擦除。"

